  "story": {
    "text": "At the Coles’ dinner, the talk is all of a {PIANOFORTE} sent to Jane Fairfax by a {SECRET} giver. Emma whispers to Frank that it must be from Mr. Dixon, the husband of Jane’s friend, and Frank {AGREES}, laughing. Later he {SINGS} a {DUET} with Jane, and Mrs. Weston wonders if Mr. Knightley is in {LOVE} with her.",
